\title{simevent: Simulation and Analysis of Event History Data}
\description{
Simulate continuous-time event history data, such as treatment decisions, disease progression and death, from a model of baseline covariates, time-varying covariates and event processes linked by Cox-type effects. Processes may be censoring, terminal or recurrent, with Weibull or user-supplied cumulative baseline hazards, and models can also be built from fitted Cox models to simulate data resembling observed data. Interventions on covariates and processes can be simulated and their effect on event risks evaluated.
